      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Glimmer goes against her Motherâ€™s wishes once again to sneak out and help with the war effort. As always, she drags Bow along with a small Battalion of soldiers to fight the Horde and hopefully gain another victory for the Rebellion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That day, Glimmer and Bow find She-ra waiting for them and invites her into their ranks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ps: This is the 5th thing Iâ€™ve written for The Crimson Star (only realized recently how that sounds like a Crimson Waste Au sorry about that-) but if I was writing in order this would have been the very first chapter.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
